n Corea. Proprio quando stanno per ricevere l’ultimo campione, avviene un incidente nella consegna. Il direttore Choe nasconde il campione, Paul lo cerca. Ritrovatisi nello stesso posto di Jagyeong e Lim Sang, chi si impossesserà dell’ultimo campione?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Tyrant","overview":"A secret project in Korea is exposed to the US so the project gets scrapped and the sample is to be handed over when a delivery accident occurs. Director Choe tries to hide the sample as Paul searches, but they end up at the same place as Jagyeong and Lim Sang. Who will seize the sample in the end?"},{"language":"ko-KR","overview":"한국에서 비밀리에 진행하던 프로젝트가 미국 정보기관에 발각됐다. 프로젝트를 폐기하고 샘플을 미국에 넘기려는데... 배달 사고가 일어난다. 샘플을 숨기려는 최국장과 직접 찾아 나선 미국 측 요원 폴. 그들과 지독하게 얽힌 자경과 임상까지 모두가 한곳에 모이는데. 과연 최후의 샘플을 차지하는 자는 누가 될 것인가."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xr2H4RgqCBHJd7KTko7DS6JtwQ2.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xr2H4RgqCBHJd7KTko7DS6JtwQ2.png","language":"en","width":2455,"height":1293},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/OwKmv2EOgQhY644xTNyD3CjQDn.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/OwKmv2EOgQhY644xTNyD3CjQDn.png","language":"ko","width":1605,"height":1300}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xgAZRY9swQYRkj3waCZeBDBCkuj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xgAZRY9swQYRkj3waCZeBDBCkuj.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f0DFr5sQ4961AT2qWboKcMNkMRm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f0DFr5sQ4961AT2qWboKcMNkMRm.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bJ6HDzaBe2VTA0tJIs8ceZiE9FI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bJ6HDzaBe2VTA0tJIs8ceZiE9FI.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rObqMbyd1B5mVGU9